  - Identify speculation
  - Flag low-confidence claims

* **Contradiction Detection**
  - Check internal consistency
  - Compare with known facts
  - Identify logical conflicts

* Calculate faithfulness score
* Apply thresholds;

if (Hallucination\nDetected?) then (Yes - High Risk)
  :**Add Disclaimers**
  ----
  * Flag uncertain content
  * Add confidence scores
  * Include caveats
  * Provide sources
  * Request verification;
  
else (No or Low Risk)
endif

